{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03913","headline":"三日曲水侍宴应制 · 阎朝隐","name":"三日曲水侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三月重三日，千春续万春。\n圣泽如东海，天文似北辰。\n荷叶珠盘净，莲花宝盖新。\n陛下制万国，臣作水心人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎朝隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}